---
import SectionTitle from '../SectionTitle.astro';
---
<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
    <SectionTitle eyebrow="About">A product security engineer with a developer's background</SectionTitle>

    <div class="about-text">
      <p class="reveal">I came to security from software development, so I read code, not just responses, and understand what the developer intended.</p>
      <p class="reveal" style="--d:90ms">I work on both sides: shipping software and attacking it.</p>
      <p class="about-meta mono reveal" style="--d:160ms">Languages: Arabic · English</p>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
